        <mxCell id="v93" value="Partner Call Center System (external)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;dashed=1;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="978" width="380" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v94" value="SMS Gateway / Telecom Operator" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="440" y="978" width="380" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v95" value="Manual work: Excel / e-mail / paper" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=11;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;dashed=1;fontColor=#990000;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="840" y="978" width="380" height="36" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v96" value="Findings: what prevents deposits and savings accounts from becoming a fully digital product" style="text;html=1;fontSize=14;fontStyle=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1032" width="1200" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="v97" value="1. Rates are calculated manually in Excel (credit and deposit back office) and sent by e-mail once a day. No system can return a rate online.&lt;br&gt;2. The deposit back office takes part in every deposit opening. Rate and special-rate approval goes by e-mail between front office, deposits and credit (20 min to 1 hour).&lt;br&gt;3. &quot;Digital customer notifications&quot; only covers SMS from the ABS; the website shows marketing info only and has no integrations.&lt;br&gt;4. The internet bank reads and writes the ABS Oracle database directly. There is no API layer for new products, and the internet bank core depends on the vendor.&lt;br&gt;5. The call center only passes inquiries to the ABS; the partner call center works from scripts with no integration with bank systems.&lt;br&gt;6. Deposit / credit data separation is enforced organizationally (via e-mail), not in the systems, which blocks automatic special-rate calculation.&lt;br&gt;7. There is no modern mobile application (iOS / Android): only a website and a web internet bank, while mobile is the main channel for the younger clients the bank wants to attract." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff5f5;strokeColor=#b85450;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=10;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="1062" width="1680" height="140" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
